{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Evaluation set for POST /api/assistant/ask (docs/api-contracts.md section 3.5).",
    "Data and charters do not exist yet. Expectations that depend on them are written as RULES over the scorecard ('expectedInitiatives.rule'), not hardcoded IDs, so they stay valid when Spoorthy's data lands.",
    "Fields marked \"TODO_AFTER_DATA\" must be filled in by hand from data/*.csv and charters/*.md once they exist. Never copy expected values from the module's own output.",
    "Do not edit questions to make results look better. Record failures in docs/evaluation.md."
